{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789191215153,"sessionID":"ses_f6be5621fffeIGqZSfrP9WiBuh","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_2640fe7cf5de41a0a4497eaa","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/toy_mobile-note-is-created-without-category/brief.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/toy_mobile-note-is-created-without-category/brief.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Brief: mobile: note is created without category\n2: \n3: status: done\n4: type: feature\n5: id: toy\n6: branch: feature/toy_mobile-note-is-created-without-category\n7: date: 2026-09-05\n8: author: Leander Muskalla\n9: \n10: ## What\n11: \n12: If I use the mobile navigation to browse to a category and then hit the \"Create Note\" button there, it'll add the note but not in the category I'm currently looking at.\n13: \n14: ## Why\n15: \n16: The user expects the note to land where he's currently at.\n17: Also, if it lands in the root, it'll not show up for the user at all, so it seems it was not created at all.\n18: \n19: ## Out of scope\n20: \n21: <!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n22: \n23: ## Notes\n24: \n25: <!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n26: \n\n(End of file - total 26 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Brief: mobile: note is created without category\n\nstatus: done\ntype: feature\nid: toy\nbranch: feature/toy_mobile-note-is-created-without-category\ndate: 2026-09-05\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nIf I use the mobile navigation to browse to a category and then hit the \"Create Note\" button there, it'll add the note but not in the category I'm currently looking at.\n\n## Why\n\nThe user expects the note to land where he's currently at.\nAlso, if it lands in the root, it'll not show up for the user at all, so it seems it was not created at all.\n\n## Out of scope\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/toy_mobile-note-is-created-without-category/brief.md","text":"# Brief: mobile: note is created without category\n\nstatus: done\ntype: feature\nid: toy\nbranch: feature/toy_mobile-note-is-created-without-category\ndate: 2026-09-05\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nIf I use the mobile navigation to browse to a category and then hit the \"Create Note\" button there, it'll add the note but not in the category I'm currently looking at.\n\n## Why\n\nThe user expects the note to land where he's currently at.\nAlso, if it lands in the root, it'll not show up for the user at all, so it seems it was not created at all.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n\n## Notes\n\n<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":26,"totalLines":26,"truncated":false}},"title":"docs/jobs/archive/toy_mobile-note-is-created-without-category/brief.md","time":{"start":1789191215148,"end":1789191215151}},"id":"prt_0941b5794001bTA2eefc3sqpCH","sessionID":"ses_f6be5621fffeIGqZSfrP9WiBuh","messageID":"msg_0941b285e00108SLgg2feUCcYB"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789191215407,"sessionID":"ses_f6be5621fffeIGqZSfrP9WiBuh","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_e11b38e33e7145a299b31a1f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/wave_todos-overview-checkboxes-not-centered/brief.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/wave_todos-overview-checkboxes-not-centered/brief.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Brief: todos overview: checkboxes not centered\n2: \n3: status: done\n4: type: feature\n5: id: wave\n6: branch: feature/wave_todos-overview-checkboxes-not-centered\n7: date: 2026-08-16\n8: author: Leander Muskalla\n9: \n10: ## What\n11: \n12: In the 'overview' view of todos, the checkboxes are not vertically centered. They should be.\n13: \n14: ## Why\n15: \n16: <!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n17: \n18: ## Out of scope\n19: \n20: <!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n21: \n22: ## Notes\n23: \n24: <!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n25: \n\n(End of file - total 25 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Brief: todos overview: checkboxes not centered\n\nstatus: done\ntype: feature\nid: wave\nbranch: feature/wave_todos-overview-checkboxes-not-centered\ndate: 2026-08-16\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nIn the 'overview' view of todos, the checkboxes are not vertically centered. They should be.\n\n## Why\n\n<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n\n## Out of scope\n\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/wave_todos-overview-checkboxes-not-centered/brief.md","text":"# Brief: todos overview: checkboxes not centered\n\nstatus: done\ntype: feature\nid: wave\nbranch: feature/wave_todos-overview-checkboxes-not-centered\ndate: 2026-08-16\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nIn the 'overview' view of todos, the checkboxes are not vertically centered. They should be.\n\n## Why\n\n<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n\n## Out of scope\n\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n\n## Notes\n\n<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":25,"totalLines":25,"truncated":false}},"title":"docs/jobs/archive/wave_todos-overview-checkboxes-not-centered/brief.md","time":{"start":1789191215403,"end":1789191215406}},"id":"prt_0941b5842001jjsc8wnpI9fNJV","sessionID":"ses_f6be5621fffeIGqZSfrP9WiBuh","messageID":"msg_0941b285e00108SLgg2feUCcYB"}}
