{"type":"text","timestamp":1789192998514,"sessionID":"ses_f6bdb1309ffeCKH5Utz6H6w7B1","part":{"id":"prt_09436759b0016iNYalkrwzUT97","messageID":"msg_094366911001KOo3sC1C7urTxS","sessionID":"ses_f6bdb1309ffeCKH5Utz6H6w7B1","type":"text","text":"All tasks complete. The job is done on branch `feature/sheet_mobile-notifications` (matches the brief), with a clean worktree.\n\n## Summary\n\n**TASK-1 — `/notifications` route + i18n**\n- New `src/routes/notifications/+page.svelte`: on mount `await load()` (guarded with `if (!userNotifications.loaded)` to avoid a duplicate fetch / orphaned `visibilitychange` listener) then `await markAllRead()` — desktop tray parity. Renders `Entry` rows with a no-op `onClose`, `SubHeading` header (`ts.get.nav.notifications`), and an empty-state hint (`ts.get.nav.notifications_empty`) that's always reachable when loaded.\n- Added `notifications_empty` to `NavigationRecords` + all four i18n files (en/de/es/fr).\n\n**TASK-2 — `MobileNavbar` bell, dot, polling**\n- Hardcoded \"Notifications\" bell row in the ⋯ menu next to settings (not in `navItems`/`desktopOrder` — `getPageFeature()` and desktop sidebar untouched), `'notifications'` → lucide `bell` in `NavEntryIcon`, `urls.notifications`, `overflowOnlyItems` extension for the overflow active-state, red dot on ⋯ when unread > 0, unread-count badge on the bell row, and `onMount(load)` / `onDestroy(destroy)` polling parity.\n\n**TASK-3 — ⋯ menu scroll fix**: `max-h-[calc(100dvh-8rem)] overflow-y-auto` on the menu container.\n\n**TASK-4 — `Entry.svelte` polish**: optional `onClose`, plain non-anchor row for link-less notifications (no more dead `#` link), `<a>` kept when a link exists, desktop click-to-close preserved via snippet-shared content.\n\n**Verification**\n- `npm run check`: 0 errors/0 warnings · `npm run build`: passes · `npm test`: 712/713 (the 1 failure is pre-existing and unrelated) · `npm run lint`: no *new* failures (repo is prettier-red at base; eslint errors on touched files exist identically at base).\n- Rendered verification with a local mock API + Playwright at mobile viewports confirmed: page renders heading + 2 linked/1 plain entry, markAllRead clears dots and badge, empty state shows \"You're all caught up\", dot on ⋯ + \"2\" badge on the bell row with unread > 0, active bell indicator on ⋯ at `/notifications`, and the menu scrolls (440px = 568 − 128px) on a 568px phone. No console errors.\n\n`implementation.md` written and committed. One note: `npm ci` was run to restore the pinned dependency tree (no package.json/lockfile changes) since node_modules was absent — needed for any verification.","time":{"start":1789192992155,"end":1789192998512}}}
